Z||000011||isthiswhereiputausername?||12-11-2001||03:14 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ali_Gulf_Fiero:<BR><B>Just Kidding!!!!! Hah!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually its mine.. I umm... parked it there once when I was staying at that hotel while clubbing and forgot where I parked it..  umm...what hotel again was it?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  J/K<P><BR>I would say get your ass in gear and call everyone you can to locate someone who will give you permission to take her home  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>maybe hit the DMV and file a claim on it as an abandoned car.<BR>Good luck and keep us informed how you get along with her  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||1
